:: Work {"position":"2100,1650","size":"100,100"}
You decided to do some work around the Inn.
Work hours:
12:00AM - 07:00AM
<<if $drinksrng>>
You served $drinksrng drinks, gaining $drinksrng col.

<</if>>\
You can:
<<if setup.datesystems.default.getDate().h gte 0 and setup.datesystems.default.getDate().h lte 6>>\
<<link [[Serve drinks (1 col per drink served, 1 hour)|Work]]>>
<<dateadd '1h'>>
<<set $drinksrng to random((3 + $DEX), (7 + $DEX))>>
<<set $drinkserved += $drinksrng>>
<<set $Coins += $drinksrng>>
<<set $curFatigue += 40 + $drinksrng>>
<<set $hoursWorked += 1>>
<</link>>
<<if $hoursWorked >= 20>>\
<<link [[Sweep the floor (15 col each 1 hour)|Work]]>>
<<dateadd '1h'>>
<<set $Coins += 15>>
<<set $curFatigue += 60>>
<<set $hoursWorked += 1>>
<</link>>
<<elseif $hoursWorked <= 19>>\
You need to work for 20 hours before being able to swipe the floor!<</if>>\
<<else>>[[Its too early for work.|Inn 1]]
<</if>>\

<<link [[Go back|Inn 1]]>>
    <<unset $drinksrng>>
<</link>>

